rq('RQ036','Do any Malmstrom or Ellsworth records show whether Mike, Oscar or November lost missiles in March-April 1967 (or Juliet-03/05 in 1966), and can the 24/25 Mar Oscar date be tested against the 341st SMW history for Jan-Jun 1967?','CRITICAL','INC120;INC118;INC115;EXP064','Testimony from Jamison, Koertner, Meiwald; Salas affidavit date','Wing history Jan-Mar and Apr-Jun 1967; job-control logs; telexes','AFHRA; NARA','Request full wing histories and the SAC telex','Documented second shutdown or none','NOT_STARTED','Obtain full histories')
